# Copy to .env.local and fill in. Never commit .env.local itself.
# Contact form (Phase 6) — free key from https://web3forms.com, created
# with the client's email so submissions land in an inbox the client reads.
# Safe to expose client-side by design: it only routes submissions to that
# pre-registered inbox, it doesn't grant API access to anything else.
NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=
